Backport reproducible image support from squashfs-tools 4.4 to 2.2-r2.

Upstream: https://github.com/plougher/squashfs-tools
Time options: 828888d, d1a546a, a033a3e, 7fa76a2, 7db33c9

Reproducible ordering is disabled by default; enable with -reproducible.
SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH fixes mkfs_time and clamps inode timestamps;
-mkfs-time sets the creation time and -all-time forces inode timestamps.
The 2.2 writer is already serial and directories are already sorted.
Use a name tie-breaker for -sort and zero unused inode/superblock bits.

--- squashfs-tools/Makefile
+++ squashfs-tools/Makefile
@@ -1,5 +1,11 @@
 INCLUDEDIR = .
 
+# Users can override this default with -(not-)reproducible.
+REPRODUCIBLE_DEFAULT = 0
+ifeq ($(REPRODUCIBLE_DEFAULT),1)
+CPPFLAGS += -DREPRODUCIBLE_DEFAULT
+endif
+
 CFLAGS := -I$(INCLUDEDIR) -D_FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64 -D_LARGEFILE_SOURCE -g
 
 all: mksquashfs unsquashfs
